如果是已知领域就好决定多了
This would be so much easier if it was lands known.

406
00:15:02,020 --> 00:15:03,819
你不是真的在犹豫吧
You're not actually struggling with this, are you?

407
00:15:03,819 --> 00:15:06,340
但假如传送门把我送去特别酷的地方呢
But what if the portal leads to someplace really cool?

408
00:15:06,340 --> 00:15:08,400
你去了峰会就赢了
You win by getting to the summit.

409
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:10,140
那个传送门有62%的机会
There's a 62% chance that portal

410
00:15:10,140 --> 00:15:11,100
直接把你送回草原
leads right back to the meadow.

411
00:15:11,300 --> 00:15:12,380
那是数学
That's math.

412
00:15:12,737 --> 00:15:15,800
而你身在魔法之屋
You're in a house of...magic.

413
00:15:15,800 --> 00:15:17,580
你回到草原了
And you're back in the meadow.

414
00:15:17,900 --> 00:15:18,936
你是怎么想的
What were you thinking?

415
00:15:18,936 --> 00:15:20,920
没关系 传说
It's fine. You know, legend has it,

416
00:15:20,920 --> 00:15:23,060
有一颗毒蘑菇下面有捷径
there's a shortcut under one of the toadstools there.

417
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:25,460
走捷径怎么能赢
You don't win by taking shortcuts!

418
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:28,708
领先才能赢 我帮你领先了
You win by taking the lead -- which is what I did for you

419
00:15:28,708 --> 00:15:30,560
我有系统地爬上高山
by methodically clawing up the mountain,

420
00:15:30,560 --> 00:15:31,760
无情地击败你的敌人
ruthlessly defeating your enemies,

421
00:15:31,900 --> 00:15:33,580
然后赢得胜利
and then emerging victorious --

422
00:15:33,640 --> 00:15:35,660
而不是在草原上犹豫不决
not dithering around in some meadow!

423
00:15:36,084 --> 00:15:38,180
我出去抽会电子烟
I'm gonna step out for a vape break

424
00:15:38,180 --> 00:15:39,660
让你俩解决一下问题
while you two sort this out.

425
00:15:42,820 --> 00:15:44,160
你知道我为什么喜欢草原吗
You know why I like the meadow?

426
00:15:45,060 --> 00:15:46,720
因为那里能让我思考下一步怎么走
'Cause it lets me think about what I want to do next.

427
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:49,240
我该和食人魔大战
Should I battle the ogre

428
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:51,760
还是勇敢面对绝望之沼
or brave the Swamps of Despair?

429
00:15:52,560 --> 00:15:56,480
我该接受波士顿压力超大的实习机会
Should I take the super stressful internship in Boston,

430
00:15:56,900 --> 00:15:59,620
还是说我争取机会只因为我应该争取
or am I doing that just because I think I'm supposed to?

431
00:16:00,800 --> 00:16:03,040
我击败了几百个候选人
I beat out hundreds of candidates.

432
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:05,340
我能与这个领域的杰出学者共事
I would be working with the pre-eminent scholar in the field.

433
00:16:05,420 --> 00:16:07,140
这是一生难逢的机会
This is the chance of a lifetime.

434
00:16:07,340 --> 00:16:09,040
是啊 但这是你的一生
Yeah, but it's your lifetime.

435
00:16:09,700 --> 00:16:11,140
你享受一下也可以的
It's okay to enjoy it.

436
00:16:12,220 --> 00:16:14,200
没人会拒绝这机会
No one turns this down.

437
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:17,520
你总是喜欢做第一个尝试某件事的人
Well, you always liked being the first one to do something.

438
00:16:18,500 --> 00:16:20,100
过个你想过的夏天吧
Give yourself the summer you want.

439
00:16:20,240 --> 00:16:21,800
你已经收集了够多的金元宝
You've collected enough gold ingots

440
00:16:21,800 --> 00:16:23,260
足够让你休息一下了
to buy yourself some time off.

441
00:16:23,740 --> 00:16:25,300
我不会因此变懒的 对吧
It won't make me lazy, will it?

442
00:16:25,560 --> 00:16:29,460
亲爱的 你六个月就会走路
Honey, you walked at six months,

443
00:16:29,920 --> 00:16:32,480
一岁就会说话 而你的第一句话是
spoke at a year, and your first words were

444
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:34,160
"抱歉我这么久才学会走路"
"Sorry it took me so long to walk."

445
00:16:39,420 --> 00:16:41,240
好了 钢琴搬走了
Okay, so, the piano's gone.

446
00:16:41,460 --> 00:16:42,700
顺带一提 刚才那声音
Oh, by the way, that sound you heard

447
00:16:42,700 --> 00:16:44,847
是货车屁股与地面摩擦的声音
was the bottom of the truck scraping against the street,

448
00:16:44,847 --> 00:16:45,460
-这... -好了
- so... - Okay, yeah.

449
00:16:45,460 --> 00:16:47,820
我说不好 小卡 这样他们会信吗
Yeah, I don't know, Cam. Is this really gonna sell it?

450
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:50,480
会信的 我在我三十六年的人生中学到了
Yes, it is. I've learned in my 36 years that,

451
00:16:50,480 --> 00:16:53,220
先自欺就能欺人
if you believe a lie, others will, too.

452
00:16:53,300 --> 00:16:55,480
-好了 把客人们放出来吧 -好
- Okay, release the guests. - Okay.

453
00:16:57,660 --> 00:16:59,060
都修好了
Okay, all fixed.

454
00:16:59,791 --> 00:17:02,268
我就知道 抗焦虑药白吃了
Figures. Just as your Xanax is kicking in.

455
00:17:03,340 --> 00:17:04,800
大伙 听我说
Hey, guys, so, listen.

456
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:07,440
天这么好我们却把你们关了那么久
We've kept you cooped up on this beautiful day.

457
00:17:07,740 --> 00:17:10,800
不如我们把派对变成花园派对吧
Why don't we turn this party into a garden party?

458
00:17:11,600 --> 00:17:13,300
你的钢琴怎么用床单盖住了
Why is your piano covered with a sheet?

459
00:17:13,620 --> 00:17:16,080
因为官方是这么建议的
Oh, um, well, because they recommend it.

460
00:17:16,080 --> 00:17:19,100
他们说这样的新钢琴哪怕受五分钟阳光直射
They say even five minutes of direct sunlight on a new piano

461
00:17:19,100 --> 00:17:21,240
钢琴键盘也会变得像
like this, your keyboard turns into something like

462
