英国人的烂牙一样
an English person's teeth, so...

463
00:17:23,583 --> 00:17:24,840
-大家为什么不 -是啊
- Okay, well, so why doesn't everyone just... - ?Yeah.

464
00:17:24,840 --> 00:17:27,621
大家拿上小零食跟已经开瓶了的酒
...grab some appetizers and any wine that's already opened...

465
00:17:27,621 --> 00:17:29,073
-已经开瓶的酒 -然后我们就...
- Already opened wine. - ...and we'll --

466
00:17:29,920 --> 00:17:30,960
大家安安
Hello, boys.

467
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:31,960
你来这里干嘛
What are you doing here?

468
00:17:32,080 --> 00:17:32,800
你没收到我的短信吗
Didn't you get my text?

469
00:17:32,900 --> 00:17:34,220
没有啊 我们所有人手机都放碗里了
No, all of our phones are in a bowl.

470
00:17:34,820 --> 00:17:36,297
-变态 -不是下流的...
- Ew. - It's not dirty...

471
00:17:36,297 --> 00:17:37,670
不像你的裙子好吗
unlike that dress.

472
00:17:38,080 --> 00:17:38,780
你好啊 山姆
Hi, Sam.

473
00:17:39,140 --> 00:17:39,960
我的妈啊
Oh, my God.

474
00:17:40,120 --> 00:17:42,200
好吧 你就这么想上人家杂志吗
Okay, you're that desperate to get into the magazine.

475
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:44,721
不是 我要让他露出伪君子的真面目
No. I am going to expose him for the fraud that he is.

476
00:17:44,721 --> 00:17:48,380
他假惺惺地说他的宝贝名单纯看个人表现
He claims that his precious little list is merit-based.

477
00:17:48,380 --> 00:17:50,440
而当我穿运动裤时 他没兴趣
When I was wearing sweatpants, he wasn't interested.

478
00:17:50,920 --> 00:17:52,360
现在我盛装打扮了一下...
Now that I've gussied up a little...

479
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:53,560
他就会把你放上封面吗
He's gonna put you on the cover.

480
00:17:54,020 --> 00:17:55,480
真的吗 你真这么觉得吗 别说了
Really? Do you think? Shut up.

481
00:17:55,560 --> 00:17:57,960
小卡 我刚才被困在卫生间里时
Hey, Cam, there was an article in an old Details magazine

482
00:17:57,960 --> 00:17:59,060
在旧杂志上读到一篇文章
I was reading in your bathroom

483
00:17:59,060 --> 00:18:00,800
在说我们应该支持自己的朋友
about the need to support your friends.

484
00:18:01,120 --> 00:18:02,300
我们都想听你弹奏
We do want to hear you play.

485
00:18:02,626 --> 00:18:04,340
-别了吧 各位 -别了 别了吧 大家
- No, you know what? - Let's not. Let's not.

486
00:18:04,340 --> 00:18:06,340
人家只是过了想弹的时候了
I just don't even feel like I'm in the mood anymore.

487
00:18:06,520 --> 00:18:08,080
你撒谎的本事比你的身形还大
You're a bigger liar than your scale.

488
00:18:08,340 --> 00:18:09,500
-来啦 -就一首
- Come on. - One song.

489
00:18:09,560 --> 00:18:11,200
没到你弹完之前 大家都不许走
No one gets to leave this room until you do.

490
00:18:11,280 --> 00:18:12,220
那好吧
Okay, well...

491
00:18:12,220 --> 00:18:14,813
我想说 你看起来好美
I must say, you do look beautiful.

492
00:18:14,813 --> 00:18:16,780
让我想起我第一次留的胡子
You remind me of my first beard.

493
00:18:16,780 --> 00:18:17,660
谢谢
Thank you.

494
00:18:18,080 --> 00:18:20,820
我是个出门是贵妇 房中是荡妇的奇女子
I'm a lady in the streets and a freak in the spreadsheets.

495
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:22,880
这也不算是个坏标题啊 如果你还有兴趣
It's not a bad caption, if you're still interested

496
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:23,940
把我加到你的杂志的话
in using me in your magazine.

497
00:18:25,840 --> 00:18:27,240
听起来有点... 单薄
Sounds a little... thin.

498
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:28,700
是啊 顶级的琴都是这样
Oh, well, all the best ones do.

499
00:18:28,700 --> 00:18:31,520
你可能听习惯了便宜 音场饱满的那种
You're probably used to a cheaper, fuller-sounding,

500
00:18:31,520 --> 00:18:32,840
无覆盖钢琴了
uncovered piano.

501
00:18:33,119 --> 00:18:38,040
? 又一个新郎 又一个新娘 ?
? Another bride, another groom ?

502
00:18:38,180 --> 00:18:40,320
电影《一曲相思情未了》的歌
Oh, from "Fabulous Baker Boys."

503
00:18:40,460 --> 00:18:42,636
? 又一场和煦的蜜月 ?
? Another sunny honeymoon ?

504
00:18:42,636 --> 00:18:44,984
太性感的一部电影了
What a sexy movie.

505
00:18:47,320 --> 00:18:49,400
当米歇尔·法伊弗首次
When Michelle Pfeiffer first...

506
00:18:51,040 --> 00:18:52,580
跳入我们的心
...leapt into our hearts.

507
00:18:56,180 --> 00:18:57,479
等等 钢琴上哪去了
Wait, where's the piano?

508
00:18:57,479 --> 00:19:00,100
我... 我没事 谢谢关心
I'm -- I'm fine, by the way.

509
00:19:00,100 --> 00:19:01,698
我们把钢琴弄走了
So, we did get rid of the piano.

510
00:19:01,698 --> 00:19:03,440
因为我们供不起了
Um, we -- we can't afford it anymore.

511
00:19:03,440 --> 00:19:06,600
我得到的那个好工作 又没了
That great job that I had? Uh, I lost it.

512
00:19:07,540 --> 00:19:07,980
所以...
So...

513
00:19:07,980 --> 00:19:10,160
我之前对我朋友的评价真是大错特错
I couldn't have been more wrong about our friends.

514
00:19:10,260 --> 00:19:12,900
的确 他们有时候挺尖酸刻薄
I mean, yes, yes, they can be snarky at times,

515
00:19:12,900 --> 00:19:15,340
但当我们真的需要他们支持鼓励时
but when I really needed their support,

516
00:19:15,340 --> 00:19:16,620
他们也对我们献出全心全意
they were completely there for me.

517
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:17,980
或许你应该重新审视自己人生
You know, you should take a look at your life

518
00:19:17,980 --> 00:19:19,939
看看是什么让你这么难以信任别人
and see what happened to make you so untrusting.

519
00:19:19,939 --> 00:19:21,974
是应该反省了
I should. G-Gaw!

520
00:19:21,974 --> 00:19:23,600
然后想到我们还把人家都锁厕所里
And to think we -- we locked them in that bathroom

521
00:19:23,600 --> 00:19:24,440
也没个理由或通知
for no reason.

522
00:19:24,520 --> 00:19:25,600
肯定也不好受吧
That couldn't have been fun.

523
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:26,740
是啊
Yeah, I know.

524
00:19:26,898 --> 00:19:28,956
这件事也曾经发生在我身上过 还记得吗
Uh, the same thing happened to me once, remember?

525
00:19:28,956 --> 00:19:30,795
就是有一次门把真的意外掉下来了
When that -- the handle accidentally fell off.

526
00:19:30,795 --> 00:19:32,524
就是... 就是我们第一次吵架那晚
The -- The -- The night of our first fight.

527
00:19:32,524 --> 00:19:33,996
是啊 好像记得吧
Yeah. Yeah, vaguely.

528
00:19:36,560 --> 00:19:38,480
那是意外不是人为 对吧
That was an accident, right?

529
00:19:39,006 --> 00:19:41,440
-小卡 -你把门把修好了吗
- Cam. - Did you fix the door knob yet?

530
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:42,400
再一会儿 宝贝
Just another minute, sweetie.

531
00:19:43,200 --> 00:19:43,720
小卡
Cam!

532
00:19:44,260 --> 00:19:46,120
我跟乔谈过了
I talked to Joe

533
00:19:46,120 --> 00:19:47,940
谈了他看到的事
about what he saw,

534
00:19:47,940 --> 00:19:49,600
他现在不害怕了
and he's not scared anymore.

535
00:19:49,600 --> 00:19:51,300
很好 那你也能让我不怕吗
Great. Can you do the same for me?

536
00:19:51,420 --> 00:19:52,620
抱歉我不该打你啦
I'm sorry I did that to you,

537
00:19:52,620 --> 00:19:54,840
但我真的以为你想要玩那个嘛
but I really thought that that's what you wanted

538
00:19:54,840 --> 00:19:56,440
因为你也是这么打我啊
because that's what you did to me.

539
00:19:56,500 --> 00:19:57,240
但我是因为听到了
But I heard you tell

540
00:19:57,240 --> 00:19:59,180
你跟朋友说打屁股会有帮助啊
Rebecca you thought that spanking would help.

541
00:19:59,500 --> 00:20:01,516
是对管教乔要打扫房间
With Joe and his room.

542
00:20:01,516 --> 00:20:05,020
所以我们这是一场误会
So...it was a misunderstanding.

543
00:20:05,020 --> 00:20:05,480
是啊
Exactly.

544
00:20:05,740 --> 00:20:07,560
所以我们的床事没有缺少什么
So, there's nothing missing from our love life.

545
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:08,860
-是的 -那就好
-Right. - Right.

546
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:14,760
但你懂 虽然说没缺少什么
Yeah, but, you know, that nothing is missing

547
00:20:14,760 --> 00:20:17,620
但这不代表不能加点新花样进去啊
doesn't mean that we cannot add a little something to it.

548
00:20:17,620 --> 00:20:18,738
是啊 我老实说
Yes, I'm being honest.

549
00:20:18,738 --> 00:20:21,440
我的确是有一点想点的"曲目"
I've got a...few requests for the band.

550
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:22,260
比如呢
Like what?

551
00:20:23,620 --> 00:20:25,800
我觉得说出口有点怪
You know, I feel weird talking about it.

552
00:20:25,980 --> 00:20:27,580
要不我们写下有兴趣的项目
Why don't we write some of this stuff down,

553
00:20:27,620 --> 00:20:29,420
丢进帽子里 然后抽签决定吧
toss it in a hat, and see what we pull out?

554
00:20:30,220 --> 00:20:31,800
这条你很快啊
You fired that right off.

555
00:20:32,560 --> 00:20:33,960
你那个感觉很有意思
That one sounds fun.

556
00:20:34,580 --> 00:20:35,340
不许偷看
No peeking.

557
00:20:35,500 --> 00:20:38,010
我说过我会做那条了
Ay, I said I was gonna do that one.

558
00:20:38,900 --> 00:20:39,380
是啊
Right.

559
00:20:40,523 --> 00:20:41,975
-我们上楼进房说吧 -好
- Let's take it upstairs. - Okay.

560
00:20:46,560 --> 00:20:48,500
-这是什么 -我知道了
- What's this? - Oh, you know what?

561
00:20:48,580 --> 00:20:51,060
这帽子本来是曼尼在玩猜电影名游戏用的
I think that is the hat that Manny uses to play charades.

562
00:20:51,200 --> 00:20:53,280
那就好 因为我可没这柔软度
That's a relief, because I don't think I'm flexible enough

563
00:20:53,280 --> 00:20:54,540
做出什么《飞天万能车》式
for a "Chitty Chitty Bang Bang."

564
00:20:57,820 --> 00:20:59,260
准备好来第二轮了吗
You ready for round two?

565
00:20:59,400 --> 00:21:00,820
当然啦
Of course I am.

566
00:21:03,240 --> 00:21:04,553
你在被子里干嘛
What are you doing down there?

567
00:21:04,553 --> 00:21:06,560
单子写着我的左脚啊
It says My Left Foot.

568
00:21:06,560 --> 00:21:07,980
你抽到的是电影《我的左脚》
You got another movie.

569
00:21:09,580 --> 00:21:11,657
天啊 真是太爽了 这招式叫什么啊
God, that was amazing. What do you call that?

570
00:21:11,657 --> 00:21:13,840
叫《飞天万能车》
That's a chitty chitty bang bang.

571
00:21:13,840 --> 00:21:15,120
你确定吗
You sure about this?

572
00:21:15,360 --> 00:21:16,939
亲爱的 别让我有反悔的机会啊
Honey, don't give me a chance to change my mind.

573
00:21:16,939 --> 00:21:20,760
我是佐艾尔 一个5级巫师
I'm Zorel, a 5th-level wizard

574
00:21:20,760 --> 00:21:21,960
草原之王
Master of the meadow.

575
00:21:22,780 --> 00:21:24,040
准你戴着胡子
You can keep the beard,

576
00:21:24,380 --> 00:21:25,000
但你不许说话
but no talking.
